Lyteweight, including all modifications, is available at:

  https://github.com/Zachzewang/Lyteweight

Modifications made in this fork (see the git history for full details):

  - Rebranded the web app (name, logo, icons, PWA manifest, page metadata) from Liftosaur to Lyteweight.
  - Added a "local-only" build mode: the app never contacts Liftosaur's servers, data stays in the browser's
    storage, cloud sign-in/sync is hidden, and features that upstream gates behind a subscription are
    unlocked.
  - Removed third-party analytics and error reporting (Google Analytics, Rollbar, consent banner) and the
    Sign in with Apple script from the app page.
  - Rewrote the service worker so the app installs and works offline as an iOS/Android home-screen PWA.
  - Replaced the hosting configuration (_redirects, _headers) for static hosting on Cloudflare Pages, and added
    the `npm run build:pwa` script.

"Liftosaur" is the name of the original project and is used here only to credit it.
